1:[["$","a",null,{"className":"skip","href":"#mechanism","children":"Skip to the guide"}],["$","header",null,{"className":"mast","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"#top","className":"wordmark","children":["gadi.fm ",["$","span",null,{"children":"/ field notes"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"14 SEP 2026 · FIELD GUIDE"}]]}],["$","main",null,{"id":"top","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"opening","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"AI × GAMES · A FIELD GUIDE FOR GADI"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":["The new",["$","br",null,{}],"game makers",["$","span",null,{"children":"."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"deck","children":"The models got better. Now the interesting part is what people build with them."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"intro","children":"Why OpenGame feels possible now, who else is building, and what the real results teach us. Follow the diagrams, meet the makers, and distinguish a technical breakthrough from a product people return to."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"readline","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"≈ 20 MINUTES + DEMOS"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#mechanism","children":"Begin the guide ↓"}]]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"lead-media","children":[["$","video",null,{"controls":true,"playsInline":true,"preload":"none","poster":"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/blog/how-to-build-games/video-poster-db64d9717e3b.webp","children":[["$","source",null,{"src":"https://cdn.openai.com/devhub/blog/how-to-build-games/c72d1059-324e-4733-8359-89c326600fe2.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"Your browser cannot play this video. Use the creator’s walkthrough below."]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Start with something real."}]," Thomas Ricouard’s ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Void Explorer"}],". Watch the transition from space to a planet. Astra helped build the code, Blender assets and repeatable playtests; Ricouard directed the result. The game has 2,048 star systems and over 10,000 procedural planets—not thousands of individually designed experiences. This is a technical demonstration, with no adoption result disclosed. ",["$","span",null,{"className":"refs","children":[["$","a","astra",{"href":"https://developers.openai.com/blog/how-to-build-games-with-astra","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Thomas Ricouard / OpenAI"," ↗"]}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://void-explorer.openai.chatgpt.site/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Open the actual game ↗"}]]}]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"chapter-nav","aria-label":"Guide chapters","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"#mechanism","children":"01 The tech"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#makers","children":"02 The people"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#products","children":"03 The products"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#frontier","children":"04 The frontier"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#adoption","children":"05 The evidence"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#opengame","children":"06 OpenGame"}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"fresh","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"WHAT JUST CHANGED"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Sep 1"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["World Labs’ Atlas moves toward precise spatial control.",["$","span",null,{"children":"SELECT-PARTNER EARLY ACCESS"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Sep 4"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Void Explorer shows a broader game-building workflow.",["$","span",null,{"children":"CREATOR DEMONSTRATION"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Sep 11"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Roblox expands its prompt-to-game Build alpha.",["$","span",null,{"children":"LIMITED REGIONAL ALPHA"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"fresh-note","children":["These are different kinds of progress. The guide keeps their status visible. ",["$","span",null,{"className":"refs","children":[["$","a","atlas",{"href":"https://www.worldlabs.ai/blog/atlas","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["World Labs"," ↗"]}],["$","a","astra",{"href":"https://developers.openai.com/blog/how-to-build-games-with-astra","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Thomas Ricouard / OpenAI"," ↗"]}],["$","a","build",{"href":"https://about.roblox.com/newsroom/2026/09/rdc-2026-the-world-needs-more-play","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["David Baszucki / Roblox"," ↗"]}]]}]]}]]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"]}],"$L14"]
