19:["$","p",null,{"className":"prose","children":["The ",["$","b",null,{"children":"harness"}]," is everything around the model that makes that loop work: tools, project context, saved versions, tests and feedback. A strong model inside a weak harness may still produce a fragile game. A good harness gives the model the right evidence and lets the creator recover when a change goes wrong."]}]
1a:["$","p",null,{"className":"source-note","children":["This explanation is our synthesis. Concrete tool loops appear in Roblox and Unity’s editor workflows. ",["$","span",null,{"className":"refs","children":[["$","a","agentic",{"href":"https://about.roblox.com/newsroom/2026/04/roblox-studio-going-agentic","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Roblox"," ↗"]}],["$","a","unity",{"href":"https://unity.com/blog/unity-ai-how-to-get-started","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Unity"," ↗"]}]]}]]}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"className":"two-notes","children":[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"SEPTEMBER / MODEL PROGRESS"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Longer tasks, fewer lost threads."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Anthropic’s Fable 5.1 release emphasizes sustained coding and verification. Its launch includes Canva’s report of building a rhythm game with music and on-beat play. That is vendor-published customer testimony, not proof of a polished commercial release."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"The mechanism:"}]," timing, audio and input need to work together. A better model can coordinate more of that interdependent work before the creator has to intervene. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-fable-and-mythos-5-1","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Anthropic’s release ↗"}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"SEPTEMBER 10 / PRODUCT PROGRESS"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"The workflow lasts beyond one chat."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Cursor Projects adds a coordinator that delegates work, keeps shared project context and runs cloud agents after the laptop closes. It launched as a beta rollout."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"The mechanism:"}]," remembering the project and running work over time are product capabilities around the model. They can help a creator maintain a growing game, but do not themselves guarantee good game design. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://cursor.com/changelog/projects","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Cursor’s release ↗"}]]}]]}]]}]
1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"margin-note","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"A test can prove “the door opens.”"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"It cannot by itself prove “opening this door feels satisfying.” Response time, sound, anticipation and difficulty are part of game design. Faster implementation gives a creator more chances to tune them; it does not automatically supply taste."}]]}]
1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"case-metric","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"20 clinics"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"approximately, reported in May interview"}]]}]
1e:["$","p",null,{"children":"Chu described making over 40 health-education games using Rosebud, served through roughly 40 Android consoles. Hosted browser games let him update the library centrally. Heydoc separately reports a two-practice, 30-day pilot with 1,420 users and 262 survey respondents."}]
1f:["$","p",null,{"className":"lesson-point","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"What you learn."}]," ","The new creator may bring expertise and access to users, rather than programming knowledge. A useful distribution channel can matter more than spectacular graphics."]}]
20:["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What this result does—and does not—prove"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Deployment numbers are reported by the maker. The survey measures ease and satisfaction, not improved health. The homepage currently lists 35+ games; 40+ is the dated interview claim."}]]}]
21:["$","span",null,{"className":"refs","children":[["$","a","heydoc",{"href":"https://lab.rosebud.ai/blog/from-waiting-room-boredom-to-life-saving-lessons-how-heydoc-built-40-health-games-on-rosebud","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Rosebud + Dr. Sidney Chu"," ↗"]}],["$","a","pilot",{"href":"https://www.heydoc.co/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Heydoc"," ↗"]}]]}]
